# Internal reserve frozen before execution; not an external blinded benchmark.
# Development seed 7132026 / 16 cases. Tests also use explicitly separate seeds.
# Per seed: 8 remapped 2x2 grids, 8 depth-3 protocols, 8 document pipelines,
# 8 novel 3x3 grids. All have 4 actions; reset state and injective output/action
# labels are randomized. Sources: learned 2x2 grid, depth-3 protocol, pipeline.
# Learner receives only the source atlas, action count, context and query callback.
# Supplied reset, discrete actions/replies and goal tokens are not learned semantics.
# Policies: active structural transfer, random transfer, from-scratch discovery.
# All three use the same candidate-based bounded conformance: access sequences,
# middle depth 2, characterizing suffixes, plus all length-4 action words.
# Cache counts report physical resets/actions separately from chosen learning probes.
# Limits: 128 states, 32768 uncached queries, 800000 actions; transfer search
# additionally has at most 65536 hypotheses / 128 probes / 4096 probe steps.
# Selection uses no target states, transition table, label mappings or audit witness.
# After fit: reachable product audit, independent goal rollouts, save/reload.
# Goals include each reachable symbol and one absent control, not all complex plans.
# New 9-state representation is separately learned, audited, persisted/reloaded,
# appended without replacing old sources, then reused on a differently wired grid.
# Record failures and fallback reasons. No tuning after this reserve is opened.
# Timing fit includes search/cache/common conformance, not audit/storage/planning.
# Source training and extra representation growth/reuse are reported separately.
